---
interface Props {
  lang: 'ar' | 'en';
}

const { lang } = Astro.props;
---

<figure class="diagram-figure" aria-label={lang === 'ar' ? 'مقارنة بين مصافحة TCP ومصافحة QUIC عبر UDP' : 'Transport connection comparison: TCP 3-way handshake vs QUIC over UDP'}>
  <div class="diagram-header">
    <span class="diagram-tag">
      {lang === 'ar' ? 'مخطط 04 / طبقة النقل' : 'DIAGRAM 04 / TRANSPORT LAYER'}
    </span>
    <span>
      {lang === 'ar' ? 'مصافحة TCP الثلاثية (HTTP/1 & 2) مقابل QUIC (HTTP/3)' : 'TCP 3-Way Handshake vs QUIC over UDP (HTTP/3)'}
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="diagram-svg-container">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 820 280" width="100%" height="auto" style="min-width: 640px; display: block;" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <pattern id="trans-hatch" width="6" height="6" patternTransform="rotate(45 0 0)" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="6" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-opacity="0.12" />
        </pattern>
        <marker id="trans-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z" fill="#151515" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="trans-arrow-olive" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z" fill="#5F6849" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- Frame -->
      <rect x="8" y="8" width="804" height="264" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-opacity="0.25" />
      <line x1="8" y1="24" x2="8" y2="8" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="2" />
      <line x1="8" y1="8" x2="24" y2="8" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="2" />
      <line x1="812" y1="256" x2="812" y2="272" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="2" />
      <line x1="812" y1="272" x2="796" y2="272" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="2" />

      <!-- PATH A: CLASSIC TCP 3-WAY HANDSHAKE (LEFT BOX) -->
      <g transform="translate(25, 30)">
        <rect width="370" height="210" fill="#F4F1E9" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.4" />
        <rect width="370" height="24" fill="#EBE7DE" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="14" y="16" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="700" fill="#151515">PATH A: TCP 3-WAY HANDSHAKE (HTTP/1.1 &amp; HTTP/2)</text>

        <!-- Vertical Lifelines -->
        <text x="50" y="48" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">CLIENT</text>
        <line x1="75" y1="56" x2="75" y2="190" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />

        <text x="280" y="48" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">SERVER</text>
        <line x1="305" y1="56" x2="305" y2="190" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />

        <!-- 1. SYN -->
        <path d="M 75 75 L 305 105" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#trans-arrow)" />
        <rect x="135" y="76" width="110" height="15" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.6" />
        <text x="140" y="87" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">1. SYN (seq = X)</text>

        <!-- 2. SYN-ACK -->
        <path d="M 305 115 L 75 145" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#trans-arrow-olive)" />
        <rect x="110" y="116" width="160" height="15" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="0.8" />
        <text x="115" y="127" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="#5F6849">2. SYN-ACK (ack=X+1, seq=Y)</text>

        <!-- 3. ACK -->
        <path d="M 75 155 L 305 185" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#trans-arrow)" />
        <rect x="130" y="156" width="120" height="15" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.6" />
        <text x="135" y="167" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">3. ACK (ack = Y+1)</text>

        <text x="20" y="202" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7" fill="#5F5D56">Latency: 1 RTT before TLS can begin</text>
      </g>

      <!-- PATH B: MODERN QUIC OVER UDP (RIGHT BOX) -->
      <g transform="translate(425, 30)">
        <rect width="370" height="210" fill="#F4F1E9" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <rect width="370" height="24" fill="#EBE7DE" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="14" y="16" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="700" fill="#5F6849">PATH B: HTTP/3 → QUIC OVER UDP</text>

        <!-- Vertical Lifelines -->
        <text x="50" y="44" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">CLIENT</text>
        <line x1="75" y1="50" x2="75" y2="185" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />

        <text x="280" y="44" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">SERVER</text>
        <line x1="305" y1="50" x2="305" y2="185" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />

        <!-- 1. QUIC Initial (Combined Transport + TLS 1.3) -->
        <path d="M 75 70 L 305 100" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#trans-arrow-olive)" />
        <rect x="95" y="68" width="190" height="18" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="0.8" />
        <text x="100" y="80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.2" font-weight="700" fill="#5F6849">1. Initial Connection: 1-RTT Start</text>

        <!-- 2. QUIC Handshake Response -->
        <path d="M 305 110 L 75 140" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#trans-arrow)" />
        <rect x="95" y="108" width="190" height="18" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.8" />
        <text x="100" y="120" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.2" font-weight="700" fill="#151515">2. Server Handshake + Cert</text>

        <!-- Ready Box -->
        <rect x="95" y="146" width="190" height="20" fill="url(#trans-hatch)" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="102" y="159" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.2" font-weight="700" fill="#5F6849">✓ 1-RTT Handshake Complete</text>

        <!-- Resumption Note -->
        <rect x="14" y="176" width="342" height="24" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="0.6" stroke-dasharray="2 2" />
        <text x="20" y="191" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="6.8" fill="#5F5D56">0-RTT: only for resumed sessions with valid prior state</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <figcaption class="diagram-caption">
    {lang === 'ar'
      ? 'الشكل 04: طبقة النقل — المصافحة الثلاثية الكلاسيكية لبروتوكول TCP (SYN, SYN-ACK, ACK) في HTTP/1 وHTTP/2 مقابل بروتوكول QUIC المبني فوق UDP لـ HTTP/3. يتطلب الاتصال الأولي عادةً مصافحة 1-RTT تدمج معايير النقل وتشفير TLS 1.3، بينما يتاح 0-RTT فقط لاستئناف الاتصال عند وجود حالة جلسة سابقة صالحة.'
      : 'Figure 04: Transport layer connection — the classic TCP 3-way handshake (SYN, SYN-ACK, ACK) for HTTP/1.1 & HTTP/2 vs. QUIC over UDP for HTTP/3. An initial connection normally requires a 1-RTT handshake combining transport parameters and TLS 1.3 key agreement; 0-RTT is possible only when resuming a connection with valid previous session state.'}
  </figcaption>
</figure>
